[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888527216","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106534#issuecomment-2888527216","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106534","id":2888527216,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sK21w","user":{"login":"FabriceCastel","id":2886675,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4ODY2NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2886675?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FabriceCastel","html_url":"https://github.com/FabriceCastel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FabriceCastel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FabriceCastel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FabriceCastel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FabriceCastel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FabriceCastel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FabriceCastel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FabriceCastel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FabriceCastel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FabriceCastel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T18:27:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T18:28:17Z","body":"The repro project is dead simple, it's a RTL container with two children nodes:\n\n<img width=\"914\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/745f4799-9ce9-4d24-a284-3285e1e7ae5b\" />\n\nThe script on the root:\n\n```\nextends Control\n\n\n@onready var jittery: Label = %Jittery\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tvar jittery_x_before: float = jittery.position.x\n\n\t# Somehow this call has an effect on the label's X position, and it shouldn't\n\tjittery.position.y = 0.0\n\n\tvar jittery_x_after: float = jittery.position.x\n\n\tprint(\"The before/after numbers should be the same but they're not: BEFORE=%f / AFTER=%f\" % [jittery_x_before, jittery_x_after])\n```\n\nAnd when you run it, the label flickers between two positions:\n\n<img width=\"142\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d53899e9-7a96-4c4b-ac69-723818bd5073\" />\n\n<img width=\"159\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b865e5c-8a13-4031-ad8f-ce6c785d04a6\" />\n\nAnd these are the printed logs (repeated infinitely):\n\n```\nThe before/after numbers should be the same but they're not: BEFORE=0.000000 / AFTER=135.000000\nThe before/after numbers should be the same but they're not: BEFORE=135.000000 / AFTER=0.000000\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888527216/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888530774","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106534#issuecomment-2888530774","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106534","id":2888530774,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sK3tW","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvz